 ### [Multiply Compositing](8122-multiply-compositing.md)
-Merges two sparse hash grids by taking the union of their active voxels, where overlapping values are multiplied together. It differs from [Replace Compositing](7905-multi-grid-merging.md) by preserving both contributions in the overlap rather than letting one overwrite the other, making it suitable for additive or multiplicative blending of volumetric data.
