 ### Max Compositing
-Returns a new grid whose active voxels are the union of two grids, taking the maximum value at overlapping coordinates [S1, unofficial]. It differs from [Replace Compositing](7905-multi-grid-merging.md) by preserving the highest contribution in the overlap rather than letting one overwrite the other, making it suitable for scenarios where the strongest signal is desired.
+Returns a new grid whose active voxels are the union of two grids, taking the maximum value at overlapping coordinates [S1, unofficial].
 
 ### Sum Compositing
-Returns a new grid whose active voxels are the union of two grids, summing overlapping values [S1, unofficial]. It differs from [Replace Compositing](7905-multi-grid-merging.md) by preserving the combined contribution in the overlap rather than letting one overwrite the other, making it suitable for additive blending of volumetric data.
+Returns a new grid whose active voxels are the union of two grids, summing overlapping values [S1, unofficial].
 
